# Context discipline

- Do not dump entire repositories into the chat.
- Prefer symbol-level or file-level navigation.
- If a workspace policy file exists (`.haxitag/workspace-policy.yaml`), respect its include/exclude intent.
- Legacy tools that merge whole trees into one txt are for exceptional offline review only — not the default workflow.
